## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Lore
## Notes: Talks with NPCs as a scene: the NPC's face and words see-through over the world, a paragraph at a time, your answers beside them, the NPC's services (the hearthstone, a vendor, a trainer, flights) as big pictures over them, the rest of the interface out of sight while you talk (its tooltips still there). A quest's rewards say what each item is (cloth, leather, mail, plate, a weapon), whether you can use it, what a vendor pays for it and what it changes against what you wear. Space goes on.
## Author: Saneroki
## Version: 0.3.0
## Category: Sane UI
## Group: SaneUI
## Dependencies: SaneUI
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Book_11
